====================

This file lists the third-party Go packages linked into the binaries built from
./cmd/... (lakefs, lakectl, lakefs-sso, lakectl-sso, lakefs-loadtest), with the
license each package is distributed under. Each entry links to the license text
at the version used. The lakeFS code itself is Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Generated with github.com/google/go-licenses (`go-licenses csv ./cmd/...`).
Regenerate after changing go.mod.

Entries are by package, so one module may appear more than once.


